<!-- 子程序调试控件 — 提取自 SubroutineParameterDialog 的 TabControl，由 DefaultDebugWindow 包裹 -->
<UserControl x:Class="SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine.Views.SubroutineDebugControl"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        xmlns:controls="clr-namespace:SunEyeVision.Plugin.SDK.UI.Controls;assembly=SunEyeVision.Plugin.SDK"
        xmlns:converters="clr-namespace:SunEyeVision.Plugin.SDK.UI.Controls.RoiEditor.Converters;assembly=SunEyeVision.Plugin.SDK"
        xmlns:local="clr-namespace:SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine.Views"
        Background="{DynamicResource ThemePanelBackgroundBrush}">

    <UserControl.Resources>
        <ResourceDictionary>
            <!-- Tab按钮样式 -->
            <Style x:Key="TabHeaderButton" TargetType="Button">
                <Setter Property="Width" Value="28"/>
                <Setter Property="Height" Value="28"/>
                <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="14"/>
                <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent"/>
                <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
                <Setter Property="Template">
                    <Setter.Value>
                        <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
                            <Border x:Name="border" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                                    BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="4">
                                <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                            </Border>
                            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                                <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                                    <Setter TargetName="border" Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource ThemeControlHoverBackgroundBrush}"/>
                                </Trigger>
                            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        </ControlTemplate>
                    </Setter.Value>
                </Setter>
            </Style>

            <!-- 添加按钮样式 -->
            <Style x:Key="AddButton" TargetType="Button">
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource ThemeSuccessBrush}"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource ThemeTextOnDarkBrush}"/>
                <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
                <Setter Property="Padding" Value="6,4"/>
                <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
                <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
                <Setter Property="Template">
                    <Setter.Value>
                        <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
                            <Border Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" CornerRadius="4">
                                <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"/>
                            </Border>
                        </ControlTemplate>
                    </Setter.Value>
                </Setter>
            </Style>

            <!-- 列头隐式样式（自动套用主题色，深色/浅色主题均生效） -->
            <Style TargetType="DataGridColumnHeader">
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource ThemeTableHeaderBackgroundBrush}"/>
                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource ThemeTableHeaderTextBrush}"/>
                <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource ThemeTableGridLineBrush}"/>
                <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
                <Setter Property="Height" Value="30"/>
            </Style>

            <Style TargetType="DataGridCell">
                <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
                <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
                <Setter Property="Padding" Value="6,3"/>
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource ThemeTableRowBackgroundBrush}"/>
            </Style>

            <!-- 行样式：填满整行背景，遮住 DataGrid 自身的白色背景，避免去线后出现白色间隙 -->
            <Style TargetType="DataGridRow">
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource ThemeTableRowBackgroundBrush}"/>
            </Style>

            <converters:BoolToVisibilityConverter x:Key="BoolToVisibilityConverter"/>
            <local:SubroutineTypeDisplayConverter x:Key="TypeDisplayConverter"/>
        </ResourceDictionary>
    </UserControl.Resources>

    <Grid Margin="0">
        <!-- TabControl -->
        <TabControl BorderThickness="0" Background="{DynamicResource ThemePanelBackgroundBrush}">
            <!-- Tab 0: 输入设置 -->
            <TabItem Header="输入设置" Padding="8,4">
                <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                        <DataGrid ItemsSource="{Binding Inputs}"
                                  AutoGenerateColumns="False"
                                  IsReadOnly="True"
                                  CanUserAddRows="False"
                                  CanUserDeleteRows="False"
                                  GridLinesVisibility="None"
                                  BorderThickness="0"
                                  Background="{DynamicResource ThemeTableRowBackgroundBrush}"
                                  RowHeight="32"
                                  HeadersVisibility="Column">
                            <DataGrid.Columns>
                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="参数名称" Width="*">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <TextBox Text="{Binding Name, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"
                                                     VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                     BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeInputBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1" Padding="4,2"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="类型" Width="60">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <TextBox Text="{Binding TypeName, Converter={StaticResource TypeDisplayConverter}}"
                                                     IsReadOnly="True"
                                                     VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                     BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeInputBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1" Padding="4,2"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="订阅关系" Width="*" MinWidth="140">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <controls:ParamBinding
                                                AvailableDataSources="{Binding DataContext.AvailableSources, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                                DataType="{Binding ParamType}"
                                                BindingSource="{Binding BindingSource, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"
                                                BindingDisplayText="{Binding BindingDisplayText, Mode=OneWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"
                                                Height="26"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="操作" Width="Auto">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Button Content="✕" Style="{StaticResource TabHeaderButton}"
                                                    Command="{Binding DataContext.RemoveItemCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                                    CommandParameter="{Binding}" ToolTip="删除此项"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>
                            </DataGrid.Columns>
                        </DataGrid>

                        <Border Grid.Row="1" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeStatusBarBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0"
                                Background="{DynamicResource ThemeStatusBarBackgroundBrush}" Padding="4,4">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding AvailableTypes}"
                                          SelectedValuePath="Value"
                                          SelectedValue="{Binding SelectedInputTypeName}"
                                          Height="26" MinWidth="120" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <ComboBox.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding DisplayName}"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ComboBox.ItemTemplate>
                                </ComboBox>
                                <Button Content="+" Height="26" Margin="4,0,0,0"
                                        Style="{StaticResource AddButton}"
                                        Command="{Binding AddInputCommand}"
                                        ToolTip="添加输入参数"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>
                </ScrollViewer>
            </TabItem>

            <!-- Tab 1: 输出设置 -->
            <TabItem Header="输出设置" Padding="8,4">
                <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                        <DataGrid ItemsSource="{Binding Outputs}"
                                  AutoGenerateColumns="False"
                                  IsReadOnly="True"
                                  CanUserAddRows="False"
                                  CanUserDeleteRows="False"
                                  GridLinesVisibility="None"
                                  BorderThickness="0"
                                  Background="{DynamicResource ThemeTableRowBackgroundBrush}"
                                  RowHeight="32"
                                  HeadersVisibility="Column">
                            <DataGrid.Columns>
                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="参数名称" Width="*" MinWidth="100">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <TextBox Text="{Binding Name, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"
                                                     VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                     BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeInputBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1" Padding="4,2"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="类型" Width="60">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <TextBox Text="{Binding TypeName, Converter={StaticResource TypeDisplayConverter}}"
                                                     IsReadOnly="True"
                                                     VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                     BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeInputBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1" Padding="4,2"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="订阅关系" Width="*" MinWidth="140">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <controls:ParamBinding
                                                AvailableDataSources="{Binding DataContext.SubroutineInternalSources, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                                DataType="{Binding ParamType}"
                                                BindingSource="{Binding BindingSource, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"
                                                BindingDisplayText="{Binding BindingDisplayText, Mode=OneWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"
                                                Height="26"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="操作" Width="Auto">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Button Content="✕" Style="{StaticResource TabHeaderButton}"
                                                    Command="{Binding DataContext.RemoveItemCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                                    CommandParameter="{Binding}" ToolTip="删除此项"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="累计输出" Width="70">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <controls:ToggleSwitch
                                                IsChecked="{Binding IsAccumulated, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                SwitchWidth="36" SwitchHeight="18"
                                                HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>
                            </DataGrid.Columns>
                        </DataGrid>

                        <Border Grid.Row="1" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeStatusBarBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0"
                                Background="{DynamicResource ThemeStatusBarBackgroundBrush}" Padding="4,4">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding AvailableTypes}"
                                          SelectedValuePath="Value"
                                          SelectedValue="{Binding SelectedOutputTypeName}"
                                          Height="26" MinWidth="120" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <ComboBox.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding DisplayName}"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ComboBox.ItemTemplate>
                                </ComboBox>
                                <Button Content="+" Height="26" Margin="4,0,0,0"
                                        Style="{StaticResource AddButton}"
                                        Command="{Binding AddOutputCommand}"
                                        ToolTip="添加输出项"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>
                </ScrollViewer>
            </TabItem>

            <TabItem Header="运行参数" Padding="8,4">
                <ContentControl x:Name="RunParameterContent" HorizontalContentAlignment="Stretch" VerticalContentAlignment="Stretch"/>
            </TabItem>

            <!-- Tab 3: 显示设置 -->
            <TabItem Header="显示设置" Padding="8,4">
                <Grid>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Text="图像显示"
                               FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                               Foreground="{DynamicResource ThemeTextPrimaryBrush}" Margin="8,6,8,0"/>

                    <Grid Grid.Row="1">
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                        <DataGrid ItemsSource="{Binding DisplayItems}"
                                  AutoGenerateColumns="False"
                                  IsReadOnly="True"
                                  CanUserAddRows="False"
                                  CanUserDeleteRows="False"
                                  GridLinesVisibility="None"
                                  BorderThickness="0"
                                  Background="Transparent"
                                  RowHeight="32"
                                  HeadersVisibility="Column"
                                  Margin="0,4,0,0">
                            <DataGrid.Columns>
                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="参数名称" Width="*">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <TextBox Text="{Binding DisplayName, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"
                                                     VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                     BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeInputBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1" Padding="4,2"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="类型" Width="60">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <TextBox Text="{Binding DisplayType, Converter={StaticResource TypeDisplayConverter}}"
                                                     IsReadOnly="True"
                                                     VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                     BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeInputBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1" Padding="4,2"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="关联关系" Width="*" MinWidth="140">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <controls:ParamBinding
                                                AvailableDataSources="{Binding DataContext.SubroutineInternalSources, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                                DataType="{Binding ParamType}"
                                                BindingSource="{Binding BindingSource, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"
                                                BindingDisplayText="{Binding BindingDisplayText, Mode=OneWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"
                                                Height="26"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="样式" Width="80">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Grid>
                                                <controls:DispItemColorControl
                                                    Item="{Binding GraphicsStyle}"
                                                    ContentHorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                    Visibility="{Binding IsGraphicType, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}"/>
                                                <controls:DispTextColorControl
                                                    Item="{Binding TextStyle}"
                                                    AvailableDataSources="{Binding DataContext.SubroutineInternalSources, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                                    Visibility="{Binding IsTextType, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}"/>
                                            </Grid>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="操作" Width="Auto">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Button Content="✕" Style="{StaticResource TabHeaderButton}"
                                                    Command="{Binding DataContext.RemoveDisplayItemCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                                    CommandParameter="{Binding}" ToolTip="删除此显示项"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>

                                <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="累积显示" Width="70">
                                    <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <controls:ToggleSwitch
                                                IsChecked="{Binding IsAccumulated, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                SwitchWidth="36" SwitchHeight="18"
                                                HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                </DataGridTemplateColumn>
                            </DataGrid.Columns>
                        </DataGrid>

                        <Border Grid.Row="1" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeStatusBarBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0"
                                Background="{DynamicResource ThemeStatusBarBackgroundBrush}" Padding="4,4">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding AvailableDisplayTypes}"
                                          SelectedValuePath="Value"
                                          SelectedValue="{Binding SelectedDisplayType}"
                                          Height="26" MinWidth="120" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <ComboBox.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding DisplayName}"/>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ComboBox.ItemTemplate>
                                </ComboBox>
                                <Button Content="+" Height="26" Margin="4,0,0,0"
                                        Style="{StaticResource AddButton}"
                                        Command="{Binding AddDisplayItemCommand}"
                                        ToolTip="添加显示项"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>
                </Grid>
            </TabItem>

            <!-- Tab 3: 循环设置 -->
            <TabItem Header="循环设置" Padding="8,4">
                <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                    <StackPanel Margin="12">
                        <!-- 循环使能开关 -->
                        <Grid Margin="0,0,0,12">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="循环使能:" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                       FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource ThemeTextPrimaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                            <controls:ToggleSwitch Grid.Column="1"
                                                   IsChecked="{Binding LoopConfig.EnableLoop}"
                                                   SwitchWidth="42" SwitchHeight="22"/>
                        </Grid>

                        <!-- 循环参数区域：仅在 EnableLoop=True 时可见 -->
                        <Border BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ThemeBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="4"
                                Padding="12" Visibility="{Binding LoopConfig.EnableLoop, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <!-- 循环起始值 -->
                                <Grid Margin="0,0,0,8">
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="循环起始值:" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="13"/>
                                    <controls:ParamBinding Grid.Column="1"
                                        AvailableDataSources="{Binding DataContext.AvailableSources, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                        BindingSource="{Binding LoopConfig.StartValueBinding, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                        BindingDisplayText="{Binding LoopConfig.StartValueBindingDisplayText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                        Height="26"/>
                                </Grid>

                                <!-- 循环结束值 -->
                                <Grid Margin="0,0,0,8">
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="循环结束值:" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="13"/>
                                    <controls:ParamBinding Grid.Column="1"
                                        AvailableDataSources="{Binding DataContext.AvailableSources, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                        BindingSource="{Binding LoopConfig.EndValueBinding, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                        BindingDisplayText="{Binding LoopConfig.EndValueBindingDisplayText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                        Height="26"/>
                                </Grid>

                                <!-- 循环间隔(ms) -->
                                <Grid Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="循环间隔(ms):" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="13"/>
                                    <TextBox Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding LoopConfig.LoopInterval}"
                                             Height="26" VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                             Width="120" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                                </Grid>

                                <!-- 中断循环 -->
                                <Grid Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="中断循环:" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="13"/>
                                    <controls:ToggleSwitch Grid.Column="1"
                                                           IsChecked="{Binding LoopConfig.EnableBreak}"
                                                           SwitchWidth="42" SwitchHeight="22"/>
                                </Grid>

                                <Separator Margin="0,0,0,12"/>

                                <!-- EnableBreak=True 时可见的中断参数区域 -->
                                <StackPanel Visibility="{Binding LoopConfig.EnableBreak, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}">
                                    <!-- 数据类型 -->
                                    <Grid Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="数据类型:" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="13"/>
                                        <ComboBox Grid.Column="1" ItemsSource="{Binding DataContext.AvailableLoopDataTypes, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                                  SelectedItem="{Binding LoopConfig.DataType}"
                                                  Height="26" Width="120" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <!-- 循环中断条件标题 -->
                                    <TextBlock Text="循环中断条件" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource ThemeTextSecondaryBrush}" Margin="0,0,0,8"/>

                                    <!-- 源比较值 -->
                                    <Grid Margin="0,0,0,8">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="源比较值:" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="13"/>
                                        <controls:ParamBinding Grid.Column="1"
                                            AvailableDataSources="{Binding DataContext.AvailableSources, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                            BindingSource="{Binding LoopConfig.SourceCompareBinding, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                            BindingDisplayText="{Binding LoopConfig.SourceCompareBindingDisplayText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                            Height="26"/>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <!-- 目的比较值 -->
                                    <Grid Margin="0,0,0,8">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="目的比较值:" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="13"/>
                                        <ComboBox Grid.Column="1" ItemsSource="{Binding DataContext.ComparisonOperators, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                                  SelectedItem="{Binding LoopConfig.ComparisonOperator}"
                                                  Width="50" Height="26" Margin="0,0,4,0"/>
                                        <controls:ParamBinding Grid.Column="2"
                                            AvailableDataSources="{Binding DataContext.AvailableSources, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                            BindingSource="{Binding LoopConfig.TargetCompareBinding, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                            BindingDisplayText="{Binding LoopConfig.TargetCompareBindingDisplayText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                            Height="26"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </StackPanel>
                </ScrollViewer>
            </TabItem>
        </TabControl>
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
